* ''A group kill refuses any pgid at or below 1'' (measured: a test fake with pid 1 turned the supervisor's group kill into `kill(-1, SIGKILL)` and ended every process the operator owns, twice on 2026-11-04). Every group kill rides one guard (`killGroup` in `tools/launch-codex.mjs`), test fakes use a large unused pid, and signal tests run inside a bwrap PID namespace.

